sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant P as Next.js page
  participant BA as Better Auth
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as BullMQ email queue
  participant W as Email worker
  participant SMTP as SMTP
  participant POL as Polar

  U->>P: Open /signup or /login
  P->>BA: Email + password / OAuth
  BA->>DB: Create or read User + Account
  BA->>Q: enqueueOtpEmail(email, otp)
  Q->>W: OTP job
  W->>SMTP: send verification email
  SMTP-->>U: 6-digit OTP (5 min TTL)
  U->>BA: Verify OTP
  BA->>DB: Mark emailVerified, create Session
  BA-->>U: Session cookie
  Note over BA,POL: On signup, Polar plugin creates a customer
  U->>P: Open dashboard
  P->>BA: getSession(headers)
  BA->>DB: Validate session
  alt No active subscription
    P-->>U: Free tier (3 workflows, no credentials)
  else Active Polar subscription
    P-->>U: Premium features enabled
  end
